---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="About">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-10 lg:px-20 mt-20">
    <h1 class="font-primary text-4xl md:text-6xl mb-10 md:mb-12">Behind the screen</h1>
    <div class="pb-10 border-b">
      <p class="mb-4 leading-6">Hey there, I'm Maxim, a web developer hailing from the charming city of Ghent, Belgium. 
        <span class="text-violet-500 font-semibold">Graduating from Devine (Digital Design & Development) 🎓</span> at Howest in 2020, I've been on a 
        mission to combine my passion for technology with my love for creativity.</p>
  
      <p class="mb-4 leading-6"><span class="text-violet-500 font-semibold">Web development and AI are my playgrounds 👨‍💻</span>, where I thrive on turning ideas into digital 
        realities. Whether I'm crafting intuitive user interfaces or delving into the world of 
        artificial intelligence, I'm always eager to explore new horizons and push the boundaries 
        of what's possible.</p>
        
      <p class="mb-4 leading-6">When I'm not busy coding, you can often find me immersed in the captivating worlds of my favorite 
        video game series: Super Mario Bros and Star Wars Jedi. 🕹 From jumping through Mushroom Kingdom 
        to wielding a lightsaber in a galaxy far, far away, these <span class="text-violet-500 font-semibold">games fuel my imagination</span> and bring 
        joy to my downtime.</p>
           
      <p class="mb-4 leading-6">Let's not forget about my other interests—<span class="text-violet-500 font-semibold">fantasy and science fiction 
      novels</span> like "The Lord of the Rings" and "Dune" transport me to worlds of adventure and wonder, 📚
      while cheering on my beloved <span class="text-violet-500 font-semibold">LA Lakers</span> keeps my competitive spirit alive. 🏀 In everything I do, 
      whether it's coding, gaming, or cheering on my favorite team, I strive to bring passion, 
      creativity, and a touch of magic to the world around me.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <h2 class="font-bold font-mono text-2xl mb-4">TLDR;</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc md:ml-12 font-mono">
        <li>Ghent, Belgium</li>
        <li>Web developer... obviously</li>
        <li>Bookworm</li>
        <li>Gamer</li>
        <li>Basketball enthousiast</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>